WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:02.280
Your phone alerts you when somebody

2
00:00:02.280 --> 00:00:03.570
likes a picture of your lunch.

3
00:00:04.090 --> 00:00:04.870
But a poker game?

4
00:00:05.290 --> 00:00:06.870
Apparently, that’s a surprise.

5
00:00:07.510 --> 00:00:08.170
Let’s fix that.

6
00:00:08.670 --> 00:00:09.670
Open the yellow chip.

7
00:00:10.330 --> 00:00:11.100
Choose your name.

8
00:00:11.510 --> 00:00:12.870
Tap Enable notifications,

9
00:00:13.230 --> 00:00:14.280
then tap Allow.

10
00:00:14.790 --> 00:00:17.130
Now you’ll get a heads-up
when a new game opens,

11
00:00:17.450 --> 00:00:20.000
or when you move off the waitlist
and into a seat.

12
00:00:20.480 --> 00:00:22.150
BostnMike recommends you set it up

13
00:00:22.170 --> 00:00:23.850
on each phone or tablet you use.

14
00:00:24.490 --> 00:00:26.570
It’s TLPT RSVP.

15
00:00:26.950 --> 00:00:28.710
Making life simpler for The Commish.

16
00:00:29.250 --> 00:00:30.380
Turn on notifications.

17
00:00:30.610 --> 00:00:31.980
Never miss a game.

18
00:00:32.230 --> 00:00:33.910
Save the bad decisions for the table.

19
00:00:34.290 --> 00:00:35.540
And if you haven’t installed the app,

20
00:00:35.770 --> 00:00:37.000
WHAT are you waiting for?
